<h1>Displacement has tripled since 2020. It has <em>not landed evenly.</em></h1>
<div class="explainer">
  <h2>What is AI displacement?</h2>
  <p>
    AI displacement is what happens when work people were paid to do is taken over by AI systems
    and their roles are cut. This page measures it as <strong>Displacement</strong>: the share of a
    Sector's workforce whose roles were lost to AI in a quarter. AI creates roles too, so every
    figure sits beside <strong>Net change</strong>, which counts both.
  </p>
</div>
<p class="standfirst">
  Four Headline findings from a simulated dataset of 80 countries and ten Sectors, followed by an
  Explorer for checking them yourself.
</p>
<p class="byline">
  By <strong>Madison Emshousen</strong> · Quarterly figures, 2020 Q1 to 2026 Q2
</p>

